#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:176
msgid "[19] In case the compliance rules verification failed, WHO need to inform the TNP by email."
msgstr ""

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L73
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
