msgstr ""

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L241
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:241
